{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hey there!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever find yourself stuck in front of your PC with zero motivation to do the things life actually expects from you? Then this little app we made might be just what you need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type in what you're about to do, place your cursor in the square, and watch the little wanderer set off. While you\u2019re away doing something useful, like going for a walk, cleaning up, or grocery shopping, he\u2019ll quietly gather steps in the background. And when you come back, he might even have earned a new hat for his efforts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spending Time Off-Screen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We know it\u2019s not always easy to get away from screen and deal with life stuff. This app gives you a gentle push in the right direction and a small reward for being off-screen.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Minimalist Design</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a super minimal experience. No pressure, no complexity, no real gameplay. Just peaceful vibes and a little guy walking while you\u2019re AFK.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rewarding Hats</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rack up steps to unlock a handful of  charming hats. Equip whatever suits your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you enjoy this, please consider picking up the <u>Supporter Pack DLC</u>. It helps us keep making creative content like this. And if you\u2019ve got any feedback, we\u2019d love to hear from you on our Discord :)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Julian &amp; Basti</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Hike","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3932880/afcddd36aa49cb68c41d76c583599096d3ee22ea.jpg"},{"name":"Wandering Artist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3932880/2f37bdb54fba2ea73517893e902fd89928786fbc.jpg"},{"name":"Wandering Gentlemen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3932880/b1fe3ccf6d84153ae036a8fe2016dd7d868542b2.jpg"},{"name":"Wandering Farmer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3932880/37961724facc9874260fa28247fe8c971f5429ca.jpg"},{"name":"Wandering Trapper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3932880/98d44b2613034949aedfcf7df96281188be58495.jpg"},{"name":"Wandering Thief","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3932880/e4268e817ce2ec3c3d6ea50792108e8935d0045f.jpg"},{"name":"Wandering Hood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3932880/844558bf095b07636d3c83d8e6e2068bf37e7d30.jpg"},{"name":"Wandering Worker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3932880/6680f4d79e4ba45363ea8160145ae32134cf0ef3.jpg"},{"name":"Wandering Shinobi","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3932880/fd1ec0183550858db0d8a26a0b83c9d2ed7aeb76.jpg"},{"name":"Wandering Knitter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3932880/9e95466d679569ee01851d87a22543bc3991a312.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3932880?t=1757509081","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932880/1c53cbd830ad7cac1be66534a841ae964558dd44/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757509081","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932880/9c295644d708fdbe2fc91f98b6798b7453b1a6ea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757509081","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932880/9c295644d708fdbe2fc91f98b6798b7453b1a6ea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757509081","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"M